<h3><u>Rabba manzoor karey</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>Asgar ne teer jhalke baatil ku hai mitaaya (2)</p>

<p>Teen din di pyaas de wich maasoom muskuraaya.....</p>

<p>Rabba manzoor karey meda chey maah da mehmaan,</p>

<p>Chey maah da mehmaan, itta deen to jo qurbaan, akhiye naatiq quraan.....</p>

<p>1) jada jhoola rehgaya khaali ye jada ummadi laad lagaaye aa,<br />
Jada choley wenjey sughra nu jede hen maasoom de waaye aa,</p>

<p>Kidhe sughra nu armaan, itta deen ko jo qurbaan, akhiye naatiq quraan.....</p>

<p>2) jeda naane laal me ki taasir oo waada tod nibhaa waanda,<br />
My waarke sab kuch deen utto naane da deen bachaa waanda,</p>

<p>Asgar aaqri jaan, itta deen to jo rurbaan, akhiye naatoq quraan.....</p>

<p>3) khaa teer zulam da wich gal tey jeda duniya ku muu mod gaya,<br />
Jeda paani key nai sagda hey pyasa eesawa tod gaya,</p>

<p>Kul da kul saamaan, itta deen to jo qurbaan, akhiye naatiq quraan......</p>

<p>4) wich qaimey diss maasoom diyaa amdi ne takdiya raawande,<br />
Jede laad ladaawan di qaatir payya dass diyaa tak diyaa haawande,</p>

<p>Wass amdii di jaan, itta deen to jo qurbaan, akhiye naatiq quraan......</p>

<p>5) qursheed rubaab da wich maqtal deene islaam bachaa gayaye,<br />
Imraan da qoon ali asgar karke inj sabr wasaa gayaye,</p>

<p>Howey ambiyaa hairaan, itta deen to jo qurbaan, akhiye naatiq quraan........</p>
</p>
              